  "integrationNotes": [
    "Use the same 11 immutable final PNGs in both games. No repository write, deployment or upload performed by the art task.",
    "Each file is a single standalone pose, not an atlas. All final canvases are 1254 x 1254 RGBA.",
    "Manual registration metadata is in source-canvas pixels and normalized 0..1. Anchor is midpoint between the two soles at the lower sole height. Draw registration should keep entity foot anchor fixed between poses.",
    "Torso hurtbox and weak-core circle are visual guides, not engine-verified collision measurements. Causal ring, wheel shoulder, coat fringe and firedoor arm are decorative outside the torso hurtbox; firedoor may need a separate timed attack box.",
    "For content-based draw bounds, use contentBoundsAlpha20, not raw nonzero-alpha bounds: imagegen leaves very faint alpha 1..19 traces around otherwise transparent silhouettes. No visible silhouette touches canvas border. Do not call this mathematically perfect alpha extraction.",
    "Padding requests were not exactly honored by the generator: complete physical silhouettes are in frame, but some heads/ring/soles have narrow margins. Use supplied anchor/bounds at integration rather than assuming universal 10% padding.",
    "The four faces/wardrobes are newly designed adult interpretations based on narrative occupations. No claim is made that they match unseen preexisting portraits.",
    "Only the four specified people are zombified; not all game heroes. Lee Woosol is not depicted as an evil character.",
    "Idle and lurch clouded-eye/pallor states are visually consistent after final correction passes. No graphic gore and no readable text burned into sprites."
  ],
